TEST FIXTURES
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The files under tests/fixtures/ are GetCapabilities, DescribeCoverage and
exception responses saved verbatim from public OGC services, and are included
so that the behaviour of real servers can be tested without a network. They
are the servers' own output, reproduced unmodified for interoperability
testing:

    PDOK (Publieke Dienstverlening Op de Kaart), Netherlands
        Actueel Hoogtebestand Nederland WCS, and a WFS capabilities
        document.  https://www.pdok.nl/

    rasdaman, Jacobs University Bremen / rasdaman GmbH
        Germany_DTM coverage description and an exception report.
        https://ows.rasdaman.org/

    terrestris GmbH & Co. KG, Germany
        OpenStreetMap WMS capabilities, in both 1.1.1 and 1.3.0 form.
        https://ows.terrestris.de/osm/service

    basemap.at, Austria
        Geoland Basemap WMTS capabilities, the RESTful ResourceURL form.
        https://basemap.at/

No fixture carries credentials, API keys, or personal data. Neither the named
organisations nor the operators of any other service referenced here endorse
this product; their documents are used solely to record what real
implementations of the OGC specifications actually return.
